# Spark IDE - proven ide ask bind (-> reply) + print.
# After status-path 97a3993. Ask bind stores reply text (not JSON) -
# print reply shows dry fixture Gravity.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_ask_bind.spark
# No Electron. No new asm - documents proven bind only.

ide open "examples/hello.spark" -> opened

ide ask -> reply

print reply
